{
  "_readme": "Intent Mode config. Edit with: sudo nano '/Library/Application Support/IntentMode/config.json' — the daemon reloads it within 5 seconds (check daemon.log for errors; an invalid file is ignored and the last good one stays active). Domain entries: 'example.com' = example.com and all subdomains; '=www.example.com' = exactly that name; '@group' = everything in domain_groups.group. Apps are matched by bundle ID; team_id pins the code signature ('apple' for Apple apps; find others with: intentmode inspect-app /Applications/Foo.app).",
